Package: WaverideR
Type: Package
Title: Extracting Signals from Wavelet Spectra
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Michiel", family = "Arts", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "michiel.arts@stratigraphy.eu", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3181-4608"))
Maintainer: Michiel Arts <michiel.arts@stratigraphy.eu>
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: astrochron, graphics, grDevices, parallel, stats, utils
Suggests: knitr, magick, rmarkdown, scico, shiny, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Description: Tools for extracting and analyzing cyclic signals from time series: continuous wavelet, superlet and
    synchrosqueezed transforms, significance tests, tracking of astronomical cycles and sedimentation rates, age models
    with uncertainty and de-chirped spectra. When using the package please cite both the paper that introduced it,
    Arts et al. (2024) <doi:10.3389/feart.2024.1357751>, and the package itself (Arts 2023,
    <https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=WaverideR>); see citation("WaverideR").
